a del límite no indica que se hayan violado normas. Puede deberse a razones legítimas, como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas.\nQué se puede revisar: Es importante comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden necesidades similares. También revisar si en diciembre se contrataron otros contratos cerca del límite, para ver si hay patrones o razones específicas.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 49 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 7.2 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 6.8, with a 95% confidence interval of 4.3 to 10.8. Contract [1], for 14,326 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: a pile-up of amounts just under the limit is a statistical indicator. It does not prove that any contract was broken up or that anyone acted improperly; it may reflect market prices, fixed budgets or separate needs.\nWhat can be checked: in the linked contract files, what was bought in each case and on which dates, and whether several contracts meet a single need that could have been procured at once.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"plantilla","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["51gM%2Fs3iZ9IIYE3ZiZ%2BxmQ%3D%3D","mksq9r6%2F5irLIx6q1oPaMg%3D%3D","BSjUTOCBq3CS81gZFETWmA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}